484 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 485 0 R/Alt(Three panels of grouped bars, one group per law and test: twelve Hertzforge jobs (matrix on T1, T2, T3, T4, T5 and L1; paired and ratio on T3 and T4; steepest_descent and secant on T4) and eight Python jobs (matrix and followed_poles on T1, T2, T5 and L1). The dwell jobs of matrix, steepest_descent and secant complete nearly every run on every tier with a median IEC share near 100 percent and a median over-test from about 0 dB on the linear tier to about 3 dB on the strong. The sweeps and steps complete far less on the realistic and strong tiers than on the linear, and their median over-tests run from about 3 dB (followed_poles on the linear tier) to about 50 dB (ratio's stepped sine). paired's stepped sine completes nothing.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 1112 0 R>>
endobj
